<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi courts sentenced three French ISIS members to life terms, while a separate court sentenced an MP over oil contracts, showing continued legal actions against militants and corruption. Security forces downed an unidentified drone over Baghdad and coordinated with the Kurdistan Region on weapons control, reflecting heightened air-space security. Prime Minister Al-Zaidi pressed Damascus on border security and oil links during a visit to Syria, linking regional diplomacy to Iraq's internal security agenda. Baghdad will host the 2028 OIC anti-corruption meeting, marking a new diplomatic role for the capital. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQbnVtUC00bHkxVGl6TDMtVUlSR3NGaUlEeDFtNFFEbUxSNlhMMGhIY0Z4a1llN25TNklobjAwSXZzaTN4bjRuNHNoclh5Z0o0WHJGMGNZeVVfd2JOQXoxYUxIYXNaOFY5NW9ScnRhX0Y4eDg1WXRvTmRsbGtweUR5bzI4Wnlpd1JtQlcwYk1mV2xBWi1OU0p0a0hIMmNlcnE5NFBBdmNsazM0VndaS0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Forum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPc1VJWjB6UlBfVVJWakpHcXkyS3JaYzNlQzh0QXpCZFZJOWRrckVUN0g4d2NGOXFhUDRMc3ZCN1Z4aURrR2R3U0lCcFNud3ZxbkR4MW1VQ1ZxSWV5RENmU1h0dGpKaF9KaDdHa0htYTd3ZE00bnBhNXpYdUNEdkJSMW9rbndUSmJVNUVZVGJ2SXIyVXl6LUFINVduOElNcGVUdmx1Zi1OQ2Uzc1dGNVhCamdUT2pydV82X1dtOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;19FortyFive&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQT0hUbjFKbHVPaS1HUUhxTnZqT3NxZ2lwQ1p4OG52Z0gtazZfaVJKaV9zcEFCR2JSN3ZhRENjaV9oX29PU1BjWFp1dktaSWk1WGJYS3VERGs2N2lCdVdaSWg2YWpDdHgycUdXTUVOVkRtbmNMeV9CUFZwdFNoNU9YUWNQTm9zUnY5MmdSYTRyZDE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPOWx5LW0tTDZweWN1d